# Ubuntu for Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro $release_name

Ubuntu 26.04 Desktop ARM64 for Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro, dual-booting alongside Android.

**Experimental: installation erases Android data and can brick your tablet. Read [Before Installing]($repo_url/blob/$integration_commit/README.md#️-read-before-installing) first.**

## Downloads

<!-- downloads-en:start -->
$downloads_en
<!-- downloads-en:end -->

Download every attachment into an empty directory. With `unzip` and `zstd` installed on your host, run there:

<!-- restore:start -->
```sh
$restore_commands
```
<!-- restore:end -->

## Install / upgrade

[Fresh installation]($repo_url/blob/$integration_commit/docs/INSTALL.md) · [Upgrade an existing installation]($repo_url/blob/$integration_commit/docs/UPGRADE.md). Use `$prefix-packages.zip` to upgrade; image package versions are listed under `packages` in `release-manifest.json`.

